<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>페인프리 (PainFree) - 순수 통증 기록 & 정밀 감사</title>
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#f0fdfa',
              500: '#14b8a6',
              600: '#0d9488',
              900: '#134e4a',
            },
            dark: {
              800: '#1e293b',
              900: '#0f172a',
              950: '#020617',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  
  <!-- Pretendard Web Font -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css">
  
  <!-- Chart.js for Doctor's Report -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

  <style>
    * {
      font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }
    
    /* Mobile frame styling */
    body {
      background-color: #0b0f17;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    #app-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    /* Custom range slider styling */
    input[type=range] {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      width: 100%;
      background: transparent;
    }
    input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      height: 24px;
      width: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #38bdf8;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8);
      margin-top: -8px;
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
    }
    input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #10b981 0%, #f59e0b 50%, #ef4444 100%);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Laser pin pulse animation */
    .laser-pin {
      fill: #ef4444;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px #ef4444);
      cursor: pointer;
      transform-origin: center;
      animation: pinPulse 1.8s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes pinPulse {
      0%, 100% { r: 3.5px; opacity: 1; }
      50% { r: 5px; opacity: 0.8; }
    }

    /* Hide scrollbar for tabs */
    .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .no-scrollbar {
      -ms-overflow-style: none;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    /* Printing style for doctor's report */
    @media print {
      body {
        background: white;
        color: black;
      }
      #app-container {
        max-width: 100%;
        box-shadow: none;
        border: none;
      }
      .no-print {
        display: none !important;
      }
      #doctorReportModal {
        position: static !important;
        display: block !important;
        background: white !important;
        color: black !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
      }
      #doctorReportModalContent {
        max-height: none !important;
        background: white !important;
        color: black !important;
        border: none !important;
        box-shadow: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-white">

  <!-- Mobile Viewport Container (Max 420px) -->
  <div id="app-container" class="pb-24">
    
    <!-- Top Mobile Status Bar (Visual) -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800 px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-notes-medical text-slate-950 text-sm font-black"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center">
            페인프리 <span class="ml-1 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-800/60 font-semibold">PainFree</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-none">환자 중심 순수 통증 아카이브</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <!-- Top Language Switcher: 한 / EN -->
        <div class="flex items-center bg-slate-800/90 p-0.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 shadow-inner">
          <button type="button" id="langKrBtn" onclick="switchLanguage('KR')" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-bold bg-cyan-500 text-slate-950 transition-all shadow-sm">한</button>
          <button type="button" id="langEnBtn" onclick="switchLanguage('EN')" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-all">EN</button>
        </div>
        <span id="currentDateBadge" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 px-2 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-700/50">2026.10.26</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Sub-banner: Core Philosophy Notice -->
    <section class="mx-4 mt-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-start space-x-2.5">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-cyan-400 text-sm mt-0.5"></i>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-white">기록 중심 안내:</strong> 페인프리는 임의의 질병 진단이나 훈계를 하지 않습니다. 환자 본인이 체감한 신체 감각과 객관적 바이오데이터를 온전히 보존합니다.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content Flow -->
    <main class="px-4 py-3 space-y-5">

      <!-- ==========================================
           SECTION 1: 통증 부위 선택 & VAS 슬라이더
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span>
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">통증 부위 및 주관 강도 (VAS)</h2>
          </div>
          <span id="bodyPinCountBadge" class="hidden text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 border border-rose-500/30">
            정밀 핀 <span id="pinCountNum">0</span>개 마킹됨
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- 8 Quick Chips -->
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-2">자주 겪는 부위 (다중 선택 가능)</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 mb-3" id="quickChipContainer">
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '머리')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">머리</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '목/경추')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">목/경추</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '어깨')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">어깨</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '허리')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center active-chip border-cyan-500 bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 font-semibold">허리</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '손목')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">손목</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '골반')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center active-chip border-cyan-500 bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 font-semibold">골반</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '무릎')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">무릎</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleQuickChip(this, '발목')" class="quick-chip py-2 px-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-center">발목</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Pre-existing Condition (상기 병 / 기저질환) -->
        <div class="mb-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-700/60">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-semibold flex items-center space-x-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope text-cyan-400 text-xs"></i>
              <span>상기 병 (환자 평소 기저질환 / 진단명)</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[9px] text-cyan-400 font-mono">550B 인과추론 입력</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5" id="conditionChipContainer">
            <button type="button" onclick="selectCondition(this, '요추 디스크(추간판 탈출증)')" class="condition-chip py-1.5 px-2 text-[11px] rounded-lg border border-cyan-500 bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 font-semibold transition-all text-left truncate active-condition">
              <span>● 요추 디스크 (추간판탈출)</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" onclick="selectCondition(this, '척추관 협착증')" class="condition-chip py-1.5 px-2 text-[11px] rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-left truncate">
              <span>○ 척추관 협착증</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" onclick="selectCondition(this, '만성 관절염 / 류마티스')" class="condition-chip py-1.5 px-2 text-[11px] rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-left truncate">
              <span>○ 만성 관절염 / 류마티스</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" onclick="selectCondition(this, '급성 염좌 / 근막통증')" class="condition-chip py-1.5 px-2 text-[11px] rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 hover:border-cyan-500 transition-all text-left truncate">
              <span>○ 급성 염좌 / 근막통증</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- VAS Slider Area -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl p-3 border border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400">환자 체감 통증 척도 (VAS)</span>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">환자 직접 지정 (시스템 임의 채점 불가)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-1">
              <span id="vasValueText" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400">6</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">/ 10</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <input type="range" id="vasSlider" min="0" max="10" step="1" value="6" oninput="updateVAS(this.value)" class="my-2">

          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400 px-0.5 mt-1">
            <span>0 통증 없음</span>
            <span id="vasSeverityDesc" class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">중등도 통증 (일상 지장)</span>
            <span>10 극심한 통증</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Jump to Receipt Audit -->
        <button type="button" id="jumpToAuditBtn" onclick="document.getElementById('sectionReceiptAudit').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })" class="w-full mt-3 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-slate-750 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition-all shadow-sm">
          <span>⚡ 병원비 영수증 추론 감사로 바로 이동</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down text-cyan-400 text-xs"></i>
        </button>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SECTION 2: 처방전 / 영수증 정밀 감사 (Nemotron 3 Ultra)
           ========================================== -->
      <section id="sectionReceiptAudit" class="bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span>
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">병원비 영수증 정밀 추론 감사</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center space-x-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
            <span>Nemotron 3 Ultra</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-3">환자의 통증·바이오데이터와 병원 청구 CPT 코드를 대조하여, 과다 산정 여부를 심층 추론(Reasoning)하고 원무과 제출용 이의신청 초안을 작성합니다.</p>

        <!-- Upload & Sample Inputs -->
        <div class="space-y-2 mb-3">
          <label class="block">
            <input type="file" id="receiptFileInput" accept="image/*" capture="environment" onchange="handleFileUpload(event)" class="hidden">
            <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-500/60 rounded-xl p-3 text-center cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/40 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-camera text-cyan-400 text-sm"></i>
              <span id="uploadLabel" class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium">카메라 촬영 또는 영수증 이미지 첨부</span>
            </div>
          </label>

        </div>

        <!-- Selected Hospital Bill Preview Card (Auto-switched by Top Language Selector) -->
        <div id="loadedDocCard" class="p-3 bg-slate-900/90 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-cyan-400">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar text-base"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="truncate">
              <p id="docTitle" class="text-xs font-bold text-white truncate">🇰🇷 종합병원 정형외과 진료비 계산서·영수증</p>
              <p id="docMeta" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate mt-0.5">발행일: 2026.10.25 | 물리치료 및 비급여 도수치료(120,000원)</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span id="docStatusBadge" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 font-semibold border border-cyan-800 flex-shrink-0">분석 대기</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Audit Action Trigger -->
        <button type="button" id="startAuditBtn" onclick="runNemotronAudit()" class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 via-teal-500 to-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/25 hover:shadow-cyan-500/40 active:scale-[0.99] transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning text-slate-950"></i>
          <span>⚡ 통증 데이터 대조 정밀 감사 실행</span>
        </button>

        <!-- Audit Progress Indicator (Hidden by default) -->
        <div id="auditLoading" class="hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-slate-900/90 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/30 text-center">
          <div class="inline-block animate-spin text-cyan-400 mb-1.5 text-base">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300">NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 신경망 감사 중...</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">심평원 수가 기준 대조 및 openFDA CC0 데이터베이스 매핑</p>
        </div>

        <!-- ==========================================
             AUDIT RESULT CARD (Directly below)
             ========================================== -->
        <div id="auditResultCard" class="mt-3.5 space-y-3">
          
          <!-- Result ①: Hospital Billing Inquiry & Verification Card -->
          <div class="p-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/30 relative overflow-hidden" id="auditCardContainer">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-cyan-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-circle-question text-cyan-400"></i>
                <span id="auditBillHeader">병원 원무과 진료비 확인 질의서</span>
              </span>
              <span id="auditStatusBadge" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 font-semibold border border-slate-700">
                대기 중
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">확인 대상 청구 항목:</span>
              <span id="reductionAmount" class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-300">비급여 도수치료 (120,000원)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-cyan-400 font-semibold mb-1">
                <span class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
                  <span id="auditModelBadge">NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B</span>
                </span>
                <span id="auditLatencyBadge" class="text-slate-400">분석 대기</span>
              </div>
              <p id="reductionReason" class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                상단의 [⚡ 통증 데이터 대조 정밀 감사 실행] 버튼을 누르면, 550B 모델이 기저질환과 통증·활동성 데이터를 바탕으로 원무과 소명 질의서를 생성합니다.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1.5 leading-tight">
              * 본 문서는 의료적 진단이나 법률적 판정이 아니며, 환자가 병원 원무과와 원활하게 소통할 수 있도록 돕는 참고 질의서 초안입니다.
            </p>

            <button type="button" onclick="copyDisputeForm()" class="mt-2.5 w-full py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-750 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 active:bg-slate-700 transition-all">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-copy text-cyan-400"></i>
              <span>📋 병원 원무과 제출용 소명 질의서 복사 (참고 초안)</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B Core Reasoning Role (Visual Pipeline) -->
          <div class="p-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/40 text-xs space-y-2.5 shadow-md">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1.5 border-b border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-cyan-400 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-cyan-400 text-sm"></i>
                <span>NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B 활약 영역</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[9px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700 font-mono font-bold">
                Causal Reasoning
              </span>
            </div>

            <!-- 3 Data Streams Crossflow -->
